<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8"/>
    <title>Welcome to Glass Dock __VERSION__</title>
</head>
<body>
<div style="font-family: Helvetica; padding: 20px;">
    <h2>Welcome to Glass Dock __VERSION__</h2>
    <p>This installer will install glassdock, a Docker Engine API compatible server for containers.</p>
    
    <h3>What is Glass Dock?</h3>
    <p>Glass Dock is a lightweight, Docker-compatible container runtime that provides Docker Engine API compatibility</p>
    
    <h3>Installation Details</h3>
    <p>The glassdock binary will be installed to <code>__INSTALL_PREFIX__/bin/glassdock</code></p>
    <p>When PATH installation is enabled, the installation directory is added to the system PATH.</p>
    <p>Otherwise, invoke Glass Dock using the full installation path shown above.</p>
    
    <p><strong>Click Continue to proceed with the installation.</strong></p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
